1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,729
From the top bar, you check a
patient into the outpatient queue.

2
00:00:03,729 --> 00:00:08,681
You select the patient, state the
presenting complaint, and assign a triage
priority.

3
00:00:08,681 --> 00:00:12,993
In the outpatient queue, clinicians
monitor waiting times and open visits.

4
00:00:12,993 --> 00:00:17,654
You record triage observations including
blood pressure, pulse, and temperature.

5
00:00:17,654 --> 00:00:22,199
The visit moves forward through
consultation to pharmacy as care is
delivered.
